Source: https://github.com/oven-sh/WebKit.git
Commit: 2e2aa2290fac856d6f451ceacb58f7f5b44dd057
Patches: patches/webkit

Bun's fork of WebKit, pinned to one commit and consumed through a shallow,
blob-less clone of that commit only (`zig build webkit-provision`, which
`zig build deps-provision` includes). The runtime build reads this file at
configure time; the buildtool refuses any checkout whose HEAD differs.
